OL,3,AFreddie Mercury mural unveiled at
OL,4,AWembley Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 30ft (9m) mural of Freddie Mercury
OL,7,Fhas been unveiled at Wembley Park to
OL,8,Fmark what would have been the singer's
OL,9,F80th birthday.
OL,11,FThe artwork, called I'm Mr Mercury, is
OL,12,Fanamorphic, meaning the image only
OL,13,Fresolves when viewed from a single
OL,14,Fmarked spot about 65ft away. From
OL,15,Fanywhere else it breaks up into colour
OL,16,Fand line.
OL,18,FIt was created by the street artist
OL,19,FFrank Styles, who hand-sprayed it as
OL,20,Ffour separate works before composing
OL,21,Fthem into a single image across all 58
OL,22,Fof the site's Spanish Steps.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
